---
layout: changelog
title: Announcing Appwrite 2.7.1 for self-hosted deployments
date: 2026-11-04
cover: /images/changelog/2026-11-04.avif
tags: security, functions, sites, infrastructure
---

Appwrite 2.7.1 is now available for self-hosting. This is a security release for the 2.7 line with several security fixes, including the fix for the runtime vulnerability described in our [November 1st incident report](/blog/post/incident-report-sites-functions-runtime-vulnerability). We strongly recommend upgrading your instance.

Upgrading from 2.7.0 only replaces the images. Read the upgrade notes before you upgrade.

